          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The mitochondrial pyruvate carrier (MPC), shown in Fig. 1.1, allows the passage of pyruvate into the mitochondrial matrix. When pyruvate enters the mitochondrial matrix, it takes part in the link reaction.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Describe the link reaction.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
